Package: xen-orchestra
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: cauvmou <cauvmou.8855@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://xen-orchestra.com
Depends: redis-server | redis, libfuse2t64, libvhdi-utils, lvm2, cifs-utils, nfs-common, ntfs-3g, openssl, ca-certificates, systemd
Recommends: fuse3, python3-minimal
Description: Xen Orchestra (built from sources) web UI and server for XCP-ng/XenServer
 Self-contained build of xo-server, xo-web and plugins from
 https://github.com/vatesfr/xen-orchestra with a bundled Node.js runtime,
 installed under /opt/xen-orchestra. Unofficial community package.
